# Clicks every 8 steps through the springs, wet only: each echo chirps; P2 from smooth (0) to full drip (255).
tempo 120
steps 32
tail 3
track fx1
input impulse 2 0.8
param p1 60
param p2 0
param pan 255
param level 255
gain 1
param p2 128 8
param p2 255 16
param p1 220 24
expect sound 0 32
expect peak_below 0
